 *
 * purpose: demonstrate the possibilities of Java implemented Rexx system exit handlers
 *
 * @author Rony G. Flatscher
 * @since  2012-02-23
 */

say "(Rexx-side) ---1-begin main--- RXINI_START="pp(RXINI_START) "class:" pp(RXINI_START~class) "<=== <=== <==="
sleepTime=0.01
call sysSleep sleepTime
say "(Rexx-side) ---2-end main---   RXINI_START="pp(RXINI_START) "class:" pp(RXINI_START~class)  "<=== <=== <==="
say
say "(Rexx-side) NOTE: as this Java handler temporarily deactives RXINI handlers, the"
say "                  RXINI and RXTER counters cannot match."


::requires "BSF.CLS"    -- get Java support